# A long conversation reopened while its latest turn still works opens at its
# end, the working turn in view rather than a blank viewport.
# iOS: HistoryUITests.testSimulatorReopensRunningLongHistoryWithoutBlankViewport
fixture /running-conversation/running-history
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Long conversation" 20000
expect "Review section 14, input 0." 20000
expect "作業中" 10000
expect_scrolled この会話 0.99 1 10000
screenshot reopened
